Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My reasons are none of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I just enjoy the struggle watching a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,constant tug-of-war\Nbetween you and Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I want something you're\Nincapable of comprehending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Something you'll end up delivering\Nto me all tied up in a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see if you're capable of\Ndefeating little Yugi in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and only if you successfully\Ncrush him in a humiliating
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,defeat will you get the\Nopportunity to duel me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.21,0:02:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if you beat me, I promise\Nto restore your brother's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,soul for now I have no\Nchoice but to play your game
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon, as soon as I\Ndefeat Yugi, I'll be back and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd better make good on\Nyour promise to restore my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,brother because if you don't\NI'll take great pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.87,0:02:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,in separating your soul from\Nyour body in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh air at last. Oh,\Nright. Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Ring is pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There, to Pegasus' castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.19,0:02:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right where we're heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Yugi and I both have enough\Nchips to get us into the castle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It all paid off for Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes he seems so gentle you wouldn't\Nthink he could even challenge another
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,duelist but when he duels it seems like\Nhe's someone else someone more confident
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.35,0:03:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and determined than the yugi i know\Nit's almost like there are two yugis our
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,friend who we've known for years and a\Nmore mysterious guy who shows up only when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's in over his head. Wait, maybe there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.89,0:03:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are two Yugis? I remember now, there was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,a game in the shadow realm and there was\Na bigger more serious yugi playing but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,little yugi was in the game with the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest of us, huh? Listen\Nclosely. Yugi, use the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,power of the dark magician send him to the\Ngraveyard no you got it dark magic attack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it was like the more experienced yugi\Nwas coaching our yugi something wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wondered, do you ever feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, or we'll go inside without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, since none of us\Nare even supposed to be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe we should wait for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, this is how you're going\Nto rescue your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I rescued you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He did and back then\NI barely even knew him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Burger Palooza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come right in for the Joey, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They could get me in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be 18\Nto work here If they let
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it slip that I'm still\Nin school I'll be fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to pay for my\Ndance lessons You know, Yug,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, we should\Nreally try to know Taya better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, she seems really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's very kind, and she\Nhardly ever loses her temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get me fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some ketchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't even know you worked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of attitude\Nfor someone waiting tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is all I\Nwant to do with my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait till I graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you know what I want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Study ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, park cars, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not valet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Valet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saving up to go\Nstudy dance in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, why would we laugh, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to be what you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What you said that day really\Nmade me appreciate you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That and what you did next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we found a space in the\Nold warehouse on Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Street that you could\Nuse for a dance studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet us there after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A dance studio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wait to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Joey, are you guys here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, if this is a joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hand over all the money you got in\Nyour purse, lady, and nobody will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me all your dough and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from her! You're lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn and face me, coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how bold you are\Nwhen someone stands up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come play a little game with me\Nnow, and you will learn your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a game I think even\Nyou could understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We each draw a single card,\Nand the weakest card loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win, you go free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you lose, I will\Ndecide your fate. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:06:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You are nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so are you afraid then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,afraid let's see you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,beat this card its points are really high
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and i drew the dark magician so i win
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,enough of your crazy\Ngame time to teach you a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,lesson you nut job i\Ndon't think so mind crush
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya. Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't have to worry about him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya? Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you if you remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But what was it that you\Ndid to that guy that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came to, that mugger\Nwas already on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a mysterious guy, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you ever feel there's\Nsomething weird going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you seem like you're\Na completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Does what I'm saying\Nmake any sense to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I feel like there's\Nsomeone else inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever's going on with you, both\Nof you are really good guys. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do we need to carry you guys up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think someone as rich as\NPegasus would put in an elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to believe who's\Nblocking her way into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you pass, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won ten star chips, so stand aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have won enough star chips to\Nqualify for the Duelist Kingdom playoffs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, but I can't allow\Nyou to face Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are going to\Nhave one final duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You will lose, and I will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The winds of change\Nare blowing, Yugi-Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's so smug up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus might be forcing me to fight Yugi,\Nbut it's a rematch I've wanted all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until you agree to duel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dueling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So, no longer confident your so-called\Nheart of the cards can help you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you afraid you can't\Nbeat me without Exodia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, isn't it, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just afraid you can't beat\Nme a second time, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have to prove anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want to duel, Smart Mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget when you battled\Nhim before, he slaughtered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you could do any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the little barking\Nchihuahua already has ten star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You earned them yourself, or\Ndid Yugi throw you a few bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me a chihuahua!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him snap his chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no challenge in\Nhumiliating you again, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one player who's ever beaten\Nme at duel monsters, and that's Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But how he did it is a mystery\Nthat still eats away at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was winning our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyes White Dragon\Nwas devastating his forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His monsters couldn't stand\Nup to its withering attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I drew my second Blue-Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi thought the attack strength\Nof his Dark Magician could stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But he never dreamed I'd draw my\Nthird Blue Eyes, which blew his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician away, obliterating his life\Npoints. But then... And now I'll play
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The unstoppable Exodia. Just as he\Nwas on the verge of defeat, Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow achieved the unachievable. He\Nassembled all five pieces of Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia. It's not possible. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,no one's ever been able to\Ncall him, but somehow he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you said you won by tapping\Ninto the heart of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and for a long time I didn't know\Nwhat that meant, but now I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And it took Pegasus to show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave me a reason to\Nput my heart in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a power on\NEarth that will stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Pegasus, not Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time, Yugi, I can duel\Nwith fire and passion in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.89,0:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has changed. I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fighting for more than\Njust himself this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a new belief in\Nthe heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you can't accept this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already earned enough star\Nchips to get into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to play you now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me play you for the right reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After all Grandpa's taught me, how\Ncan I deny the heart of the cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi suddenly seems different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I accept your duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see what you've really learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You just name the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dueling field has\Nbeen prepared. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the Duelist Playoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need 10 star chips, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I got them. You qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But the real fun's on the annex roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.93,0:13:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Some action on the\Nroof, huh? Thanks, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what's shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll each wager five\Nstar chips on this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and the winner will be the only one who\Nearns the right to enter the main castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Done. Five chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use my dual disc system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Insert your shuffled deck into\Nthe card recognition slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Life points automatically set to 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it once, Yugi, so we\Nknow that you can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it'll take\Na while for the other
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,finalists to catch up\Nplaying by the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so I might as well kill some\Ntime watching this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those punks I trapped underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But how'd they get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I trapped them in\Nthat underground cave forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Seto Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, Kaiba's in a rematch with Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This I gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For the duel of the century,\NI need a ringside sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to duel, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins faces Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And whoever loses well,\Nyou'll be left a broken man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who gets broken, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you once\Nand for all. Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back and prepare for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Ryukashin in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They're holograms, just like the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,On your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.67,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Curse of Dragon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A formidable card, Yugi, and a play I would\Nexpect from a duelist of your caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't patronize me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know from playing you\Nyou're a talented duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're just not as good as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one duelist is gonna\Nchallenge Pegasus, and that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then attack and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No faith in your monster? You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mightier than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Ryukashin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryukashin is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good, but oh-so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I expected that attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And once again, you've played\Nright into my hands, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You already got Kaiba on the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a bluff, as\Nyou will all soon see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Sword Stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the sword stalker gathers\Nthe life force of a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,fallen ally raising his\Nown attack power by 20
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,watch so that's why kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,allowed his ryukushin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,to be defeated so easily\Nso he could use its energy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to create an even stronger monster and now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that he's done that his\Nsword stalker's attack
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,strength is even greater\Nthan that of my curse of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon attack now sword\Nstalker vengeance strike
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,what the curse of dragon disappeared\Nthat's because i laid a monster replaced
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.59,0:17:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,magic card on the field this card\Nswitches the monster on the field with the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,monster in my hand that has the highest\Nattack power and you know what that means
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the creature with the greatest attack\Npower in my hands is the Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.61,0:17:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician vanquishes\Nyour sword, Stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaiba, Yugi put\Nthe moves on you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If those fools only knew\Nwhat I have in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can replay Curse\Nof Dragon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take on your magic with a\Nmagician of my own. I summon La Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:17:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the mystical genie
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My wish is his command
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.55,0:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,attack La Jin Dark magic attack Your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,attack activates my trap The ancient lamp
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First it protects my genie\Nby drawing him into the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,then the lamp deflects your attack\Nturning it back on your monster
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,which lowers your score to equal mine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,reflect upon the incredible\Ndefensive powers of my ancient lamp
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My deflected attack may have\Ndestroyed Curse of Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but I still have the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, for all your\Nbragging, the score is tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're evenly matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi doesn't suspect\Nthat so far my maneuvers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,clever as they are, are all just ploys\Nto distract him from my real plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To assemble all three blue\Neyes in my deck to create
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,a monster more powerful\Nthan any he's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.05,0:19:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For combined, they create the\Nultimate creature of destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
